---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { site } from "../site";

const { name, nameZh, email, linkedinUrl } = site;
const cvUrl = "/cv";
---

<Layout
  title={`${name} ${nameZh} | Research & Data Insight`}
  description="陆政豪（Zhenghao Lu），心理学硕士，专注行为研究、受众洞察与数据分析。Psychology Master's graduate working on behavioral research, audience insight, and data analysis."
  lang="zh-CN"
  dataLang="zh"
  languageToggle
>

    <main>
      <section class="hero" aria-label="Intro">
        <div class="stack">
          <div class="name">
            <span data-lang="zh">{nameZh}</span>
            <span data-lang="en">{name}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="sub">{email}</div>
        </div>
        <a class="scroll-cue" href="#profile" aria-label="Scroll to profile">
          <span data-lang="zh">下滑</span>
          <span data-lang="en">Scroll</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
        </a>
      </section>

      <section id="profile" class="section">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <p class="eyebrow">Profile</p>
          <h1 data-lang="zh">我是陆政豪，也可以叫我欧阳小司</h1>
          <h1 data-lang="en">I am Zhenghao Lu.</h1>

          <div class="profile-summary">
            <div class="profile-summary-intro">
              <p class="profile-summary-label">
                <span data-lang="zh">职业定位</span>
                <span data-lang="en">Positioning</span>
              </p>
              <p class="profile-summary-statement" data-lang="zh">
                用研究与数据理解人，并支持更清晰的决策。
              </p>
              <p class="profile-summary-statement" data-lang="en">
                Using research and data to understand people and support clearer
                decisions.
              </p>
            </div>
            <p class="profile-summary-copy" data-lang="zh">
              心理学硕士，拥有行为研究、受众洞察与数据分析经验。我通过问卷、实验和互动数据识别需求与行为模式，并将复杂证据转化为清晰、可执行的建议。
            </p>
            <p class="profile-summary-copy" data-lang="en">
              Psychology Master's graduate with experience in behavioral
              research, audience insight, and data analysis. I use surveys,
              experiments, and engagement data to identify needs and behavioral
              patterns, then translate complex evidence into clear, actionable
              recommendations.
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="lead" data-lang="zh">
            如果你想快速了解我，可以查看 <a href={cvUrl}>CV</a>，或在
            <a href={linkedinUrl} rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
            了解我的职业轨迹；如果你想看看我做过的研究，可以浏览
            <a href="/portfolio">作品集</a>。
          </p>
          <p class="lead" data-lang="en">
            For a quick overview, read my <a href={cvUrl}>CV</a> or visit my
            <a href={linkedinUrl} rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>. To see the
            research I have done, browse my <a href="/portfolio">portfolio</a>.
          </p>

          <div class="quick-links" aria-label="Quick links">
            <a href={cvUrl}>CV</a>
            <a href={linkedinUrl} rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
            <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>Email</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Portfolio</p>
              <h2 data-lang="zh">行为研究作品集</h2>
              <h2 data-lang="en">Behavioral Research Portfolio</h2>
            </div>
            <a class="text-link" href="/portfolio">
              <span data-lang="zh">查看作品集</span>
              <span data-lang="en">View portfolio</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="research-preview">
            <p data-lang="zh">
              我的研究关注人在真实生活情境中如何经历压力、支持、动机和幸福感。我使用问卷、日记研究和统计建模方法识别行为模式、心理需求与群体差异，并把复杂数据转化为清晰、可理解且能够支持行动的洞察。
            </p>
            <p data-lang="en">
              My research focuses on how people experience stress, support,
              motivation, and well-being in real-life contexts. In my research,
              I use survey, diary, and statistical modeling methods to identify
              behavioral patterns, psychological needs, and group differences.
              Across these projects, I turn complex behavioral data into clear,
              human-centered insights that can support better decisions,
              systems, and services.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section contact">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
          <h2 data-lang="zh">联系我</h2>
          <h2 data-lang="en">Reach me</h2>
          <div class="contact-links">
            <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>
            <a href={linkedinUrl} rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
            <a href={cvUrl}>CV</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <style>

      :global(html, body) {
        min-height: 100%;
        width: 100%;
        margin: 0;
        background: #fff;
        color: #111;
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
        font-family:
          system-ui,
          -apple-system,
          BlinkMacSystemFont,
          "Segoe UI",
          Roboto,
          sans-serif;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        padding: 80px 24px 64px;
        position: relative;
      }

      .stack {
        text-align: center;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .name {
        font-size: 16pt;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      .sub {
        font-size: 11pt;
        opacity: 0.85;
      }

      .scroll-cue {
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        bottom: 28px;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        color: #555;
        font-size: 12px;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        text-decoration: none;
        opacity: 0.78;
      }

      .scroll-cue:hover {
        opacity: 1;
      }

      .section {
        padding: 72px 0;
        border-top: 1px solid #f1f1f1;
        scroll-margin-top: 96px;
      }

      .section-inner {
        width: 80%;
        max-width: none;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        color: #777;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      }

      h1,
      h2 {
        margin: 0;
        color: #111;
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 1.25;
        letter-spacing: 0;
      }

      h1 {
        max-width: none;
        font-size: 30px;
      }

      h2 {
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .profile-summary {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.25fr);
        gap: clamp(28px, 4vw, 56px);
        margin-top: 32px;
        padding: 28px 0;
        border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
      }

      .profile-summary-intro {
        min-width: 0;
      }

      .profile-summary-label {
        margin: 0 0 14px;
        color: #888;
        font-size: 10px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .profile-summary-statement {
        max-width: 380px;
        margin: 0;
        color: #222;
        font-size: clamp(17px, 1.8vw, 21px);
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 1.45;
      }

      .profile-summary-copy {
        align-self: end;
        max-width: 680px;
        margin: 0;
        color: #555;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.75;
      }

      .lead {
        max-width: none;
        margin: 20px 0 0;
        color: #444;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.75;
      }

      .lead a {
        display: inline;
        padding: 0 0.12em;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #bbb;
        background:
          linear-gradient(to top, #f3f3f3 42%, transparent 42%);
        color: #111;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition:
          background-color 0.16s ease,
          border-color 0.16s ease,
          color 0.16s ease;
      }

      .lead a:hover,
      .lead a:focus-visible {
        border-color: #111;
        background:
          linear-gradient(to top, #e9e9e9 52%, transparent 52%);
        color: #000;
      }

      .lead a:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid #111;
        outline-offset: 3px;
      }

      .quick-links,
      .contact-links {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: 28px;
      }

      .quick-links a,
      .contact-links a {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: 38px;
        padding: 0 14px;
        border: 1px solid #ddd;
        color: #111;
        font-size: 14px;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .quick-links a:hover,
      .contact-links a:hover {
        border-color: #111;
      }

      .section-heading {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-end;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 24px;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      .text-link {
        color: #111;
        font-size: 14px;
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .research-preview {
        max-width: none;
        color: #444;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.75;
      }

      .research-preview p {
        margin: 0;
      }

      .contact {
        padding-bottom: 96px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 640px) {

        .hero {
          padding-inline: 18px;
        }

        .section {
          padding: 56px 0;
        }

        h1 {
          font-size: 25px;
        }

        h2 {
          font-size: 22px;
        }

        .profile-summary {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 22px;
          margin-top: 26px;
          padding: 24px 0;
        }

        .section-heading {
          align-items: flex-start;
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 10px;
        }

      }
    </style>
</Layout>
